{"id": 88, "ts": 1780430474.7628143, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 5, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate James\u2019s clarification on Candidate\u202fD \u2013 he does respond adequately to unexpected events, which is a plus for stress resilience, but the notes about arrogance, a hot temper and weak leadership raise serious doubts about his crew\u2011cooperation and professional communication.\nCandidate\u202fA, on the other hand, demonstrates core safety\u2011critical strengths: he can anticipate dangerous situations, sees complex connections and has excellent spatial vision, and he\u2019s noted for very good leadership. The gaps are his stress\u2011resilience, how he handles criticism and his organisational habits. Those are the only remaining unknowns for A, whereas D already shows a clear liability in teamwork culture.\nGiven the evidence, I still recommend Candidate\u202fA, conditional on confirming that his stress handling and receptiveness to feedback meet our standards."}
